      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Oh, and completely unrelated to the original question, but someone pointed out the other day that Unity can use Hasty Augmentation on herself if she has, say Modular Workbench out to use that and her base power to get 2 Golems out, since her abilities &quot;put them into play&quot; rather than playing them.</p><p>It&#39;s probably obvious to everyone else, but for some reason I got distracted by the +2 damage and never thought to use it on her.</p>",
